 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Out in the wilderness of Judea in the burning heat of day",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A man in camel's hair was calling and he would not walk away",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Locusts and wild honey and a leather belt of hide",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All Jerusalem came out to him down by the Jordan's side",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Repent, for the kingdom of heaven has come near",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And they went down in the river with their sins confessed and clear",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am a voice crying out in the wilderness",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Make straight the way of the Lord",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Make straight the way of the Lord",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The priests came from the city asking who he claimed to be",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not the Christ and not Elijah, not the one they came to see",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I baptize with water",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Among you stands one you do not know",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The one who comes after me",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
